title: Galleon Fleet
subtitle: A political question
tags: event, govt_affairs
is-card: true
on-arrival: panzerkreuzer_seen = 1
face-image: img/panzerkreuzer.jpg
view-if: panzerkreuzer_seen = 0 and year = 1928 and month >= 8 and month < 10 and army_minister_party != "Marcher" and marcher_in_government = 1
new-page: true

= Galleon Fleet

The Commonwealth Army Ministry is demanding the construction of a new war-galleon, as part of the Commonwealth's rearmament. Our coalition partners are united in support. While many of our members are vehemently against new military spending, this vote may be necessary to preserve the coalition. The [? if not lvp_formed: <span style="color: #D3C24D;">**[+ ddp_name +]**</span> have also switched their positions for construction, fragmenting their party.?]

[? if not panzerkreuzer_campaign: Our lack of an electoral campaign against the ship's construction will limit the backlash among our working-class base. ?][? if panzerkreuzer_campaign: We campaigned on food for children instead of war-galleons. Will we really betray our campaign promises? ?]

- @vote_yes: Vote yes, for constructing the war-galleon.
- @vote_no: Vote no, against constructing the war-galleon.
- @abstain: Abstain from the vote.

@vote_yes
on-arrival: left_dissent += 10; labor_dissent += 5; center_dissent += 5; reformist_dissent += 5; knight_dissent += 5; panzerkreuzer_funded = 1; collectivist_coalition_dissent += 1; collectivist_relation -= 6; commons_marcher -= 2; commons_marcher -= 4 if panzerkreuzer_campaign; disfavored_marcher -= 2 if panzerkreuzer_campaign; gold_left += 1; ddp_right += 1; ddp_cohesion -= 1; lvp_left += 1; goal_marcher_cancel += 1; dufour_angry -= 5

Our grassroots party members are shocked by our intransigence! Many party branches have begun agitating against the cabinet, and our Assembly members even plan a full vote on the proposal, contravening the government's decision. [? if panzerkreuzer_campaign: Our working-class base feels betrayed—we had promised to block the ship’s construction and fund children’s meals instead. ?]

The campaign against the war-galleon fails, with only the dissident <span style="color: #c00000;">**Marchers**</span> and <span style="color: #700000;">**Collectivists**</span> members voting against. The ship will be built.

@vote_no
on-arrival: gold_relation -= 8; lvp_relation -= 5; unionist_relation -= 5; pacifism += 1; nationalism -= 2*(1-dissent); coalition_dissent += 1; gold_right += 1; ddp_left += 1; ddp_cohesion -= 1; lvp_right += 1; dufour_angry += 5; panzerkreuzer_no = 1;
go-to: vote_no_chancellor if chancellor_party = "Marcher"; vote_no_pass if chancellor_party != "Marcher"

@vote_no_chancellor
go-to: braun if chancellor = "Bristol"; muller if chancellor = "Sarrow"

@braun
on-arrival: panzerkreuzer_funded = 0; nationalism -= 6*(1-dissent); army_loyalty -= 0.05; left_dissent -= 10; labor_dissent -= 10; center_dissent -= 5; reformist_dissent -= 5; knight_dissent -= 5; panzerkreuzer_failed = 1; commons_marcher += 5*(1-dissent); ddp_left += 1; ddp_cohesion += 1; pacifism += 1; collectivist_relation += 5; army_goal_marcher += 1; dufour_angry += 5; coup_progress += 1

Our coalition partners are shocked by our intransigence! However, Chancellor Bristol manages to persuade our cabinet ministers to drop the plan to vote on the war-galleon. The ship will not be built! Pacifism is starting to find support in the [? if not lvp_formed: <span style="color: #D3C24D;">**[+ ddp_name +]**</span>?][? if lvp_formed: <span style="color: #C0A054;">**Golds**</span>?].

@muller
on-arrival: panzerkreuzer_funded = 1

Our coalition partners are shocked by our intransigence! Despite Chancellor Sarrow's rejection of the proposal, the other parties bring the matter to a Assembly vote, which easily passes, with only the <span style="color: #c00000;">**Marchers**</span> and <span style="color: #700000;">**Collectivists**</span> voting against. The ship will be built.

@vote_no_pass
on-arrival: panzerkreuzer_funded = 1

Our coalition partners are shocked by our intransigence! Chancellor [+ chancellor +] brings the matter to a Assembly vote, which passes with all parties in favor except the <span style="color: #c00000;">**Marchers**</span> and <span style="color: #700000;">**Collectivists**</span>. The ship will be built.

@abstain
on-arrival: gold_relation -= 5; lvp_relation -= 3; unionist_relation -= 3; commons_marcher -= 4 if panzerkreuzer_campaign; disfavored_marcher -= 2 if panzerkreuzer_campaign; left_dissent += 5; labor_dissent += 5; panzerkreuzer_funded = 1; collectivist_relation -= 3; ddp_right += 1; ddp_cohesion -= 1

Our coalition partners are shocked by our intransigence! [? if panzerkreuzer_campaign: Our working-class base feels betrayed—we had promised to block the ship’s construction and fund children’s meals instead. ?]Despite our abstention, the vote in the Assembly goes through, with all parties in favor except the <span style="color: #c00000;">**Marchers**</span> and <span style="color: #700000;">**Collectivists**</span>. The ship will be built.